13, 1984; APP node 261437; common-crawl capture 2024-12-12T15:26:35Z","sha256":"4317587d1dd1afe9df8a82e8f349ee64affc5a2769e082e6abc191141ad7cf07","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984"},"signing_date":null,"source_id":"app-executive-orders:EO:12473:common-crawl:4317587d1dd1","strong":false,"text_path":"../../app-executive-orders/output/texts/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984.txt","why":"American Presidency Project (UCSB) web transcription: an editorial transcription published on the web, read live or from a web-archive capture of the page, NOT the signed or officially printed original; a lead to the original and to the text, never the original by itself"}],"savings_leads":[],"whole_order_end":[],"whole_order_end_total":0},"provisional_status":"yes","readiness":{"by_step":{"clause_inventory":"confirm","counterevidence":"resolve_conflicts","ending_or_current_basis":"confirm","opus_media":"research","original_text":"confirm","savings_residuals":"agent_judgment","shared_sources":"n/a"},"needs_research":["opus_media"],"would_satisfy_once_confirmed":["original_text","clause_inventory","ending_or_current_basis"]},"shared_sources":[],"signing_dates_seen":{"fr-originals@jobs/fr-originals/output":"1984-04-13","later-events_catalog":"1984-04-13","stage19_causal_queue":"1984-04-13"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:12473","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"I hereby prescribe the following Manual for Courts-Martial to be designated as \"Manual for Courts-Martial, United States, 1984.\"","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); unnumbered paragraph 1","sha256":"21351c94bbc5673909703fb22aaf97fcaf890dbb5f48ccd3d2a8eee65e969715","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984"},"scope_id":"EO:12473#p1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"This Manual shall take effect on August 1, 1984, with respect to all court-martial processes taken on and after that date: Provided, That nothing contained in this Manual shall be construed to invalidate any restraint, investigation, referral of charges, designation or detail of a military judge or counsel, trial in which arraignment had been had, or other action begun prior to that date, and any such restraint, investigation, trial, or other action may be completed in accordance with applicable laws, Executive orders, and regulations in the same manner and with the same effect as if this Manual had not been prescribed; Provided further, That Rules for Courts-Martial 908, 1103(j), 11051107, 1110-1114, 1201, and 1203 shall not apply to any case in which the findings and sentence were adjudged by a court-martial before August 1, 1984, and the post-trial and appellate review of such cases shall be completed in accordance with applicable laws, Executive orders, and regulations in the same manner and with the same effect as if this Manual had not been prescribed; Provided further, That nothing contained in this Manual shall be construed to make punishable any act done or omitted prior to August 1, 1984, which was not punishable when done or omitted; Provided further, That nothing in part IV of this Manual shall be construed to invalidate the prosecution of any offense committed before the effective date of this Manual; Provided further, That the maximum punishment for an offense committed prior to August 1, 1984, shall not exceed the applicable limit in effect at the time of the commission of such offense; Provided further, That for offenses committed prior to August 1, 1984, for which a sentence is adjudged on or after August 1, 1984, if the maximum punishment authorized in this Manual is less than that previously authorized, the lesser maximum authorized punishment shall apply; And provided further, That Part V of this Manual shall not apply to nonjudicial punishment proceedings which were initiated before August 1, 1984, and nonjudicial punishment proceedings in such cases shall be completed in accordance with applicable laws, Executive orders, and regulations in the same manner and with the same effect as if this Manual had not been prescribed.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); unnumbered paragraph 2","sha256":"21351c94bbc5673909703fb22aaf97fcaf890dbb5f48ccd3d2a8eee65e969715","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984"},"scope_id":"EO:12473#p2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"The Manual for Courts-Martial, 1969, United States (Revised edition), prescribed by Executive Order No. 11476, as amended by Executive Order Nos. 11835, 12018, 12198, 12233, 12306, 12340, 12383, and 12460 is hereby rescinded, effective August 1, 1984.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); unnumbered paragraph 3","sha256":"21351c94bbc5673909703fb22aaf97fcaf890dbb5f48ccd3d2a8eee65e969715","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984"},"scope_id":"EO:12473#p3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"The Secretary of Defense shall cause this Manual to be revised annually and shall recommend to the President any appropriate amendments.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); unnumbered paragraph 4","sha256":"21351c94bbc5673909703fb22aaf97fcaf890dbb5f48ccd3d2a8eee65e969715","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984"},"scope_id":"EO:12473#p4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"The Secretary of Defense, on behalf of the President, shall transmit a copy of this Order to the Congress of the United States in accord with Section 836 of Title 10 of the United States Code.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); unnumbered paragraph 5","sha256":"21351c94bbc5673909703fb22aaf97fcaf890dbb5f48ccd3d2a8eee65e969715","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12473-manual-for-courts-martial-united-states-1984"},"scope_id":"EO:12473#p5","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"49 FR 17152, PDF pages 168-169","sha256":"615733b40cf32747c7396220ee3d89582394c5339139cac59dbe2b6989095daa","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1984-04-23/pdf/FR-1984-04-23.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 5 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: current legal basis not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)","CONFLICT QUARANTINED_RELATIONSHIP_CONFLICT: Stage 19 causal queue: 8 quarantined relationship(s)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"yes"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:12473"}
